<title>AUSTRALIA: Coates buys compaction equipment business.</title>
<headline>Coates buys compaction equipment business.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coates Hire Ltd said on Monday it has executed an option to buy a vibratory compaction equipment fleet from Specialised Plant Hire for less than A$8 million.</p>
<p>Coates said the group operates in Victoria and South Australia and would complement and be rationalised with Coates' existing compaction hire business in those states.</p>
<p>Settlement is expected to take place on August 1.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
